From 65e18f963ac3e62b9087922361aa04b84a854dea Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 01:26:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Park native gateway turns at durable update
 boundaries

Bind the shared update-pause signal to eligible canonical gateway turns and
retain completed-tool suffixes without terminalizing their FIFO admissions.
Persist a versioned, generation/epoch/lineage-bound checkpoint; consume it
before resume and fail closed on uncertain work. Account quiescent checkpoints
as parked work and preserve current authorization, Stop, mute and heartbeat
semantics across restart or in-place resume.

Proof: parent d9b0935a RED times out at the missing gateway boundary hook.
Final focused pause/update suites: 423 passed, 9 skipped, zero failures (43 files).
Broad existing update/restart suite: 2848 passed, 122 skipped (285 files).
Remaining-guard mutation audit: 59 killed, 3 preexisting clauses excluded,
2 redundant finite-only clauses removed; no remaining survivors.
Full scripts/check against parent passes all 18 checks. Native real-agent
composed tests verify one tool effect, same admission continuation and quiet
notice/heartbeat behavior. MacBook live update proof is separately owned.
